  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/983/world-border-variant-header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"71\"></p>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这款简单的世界边界变体资源包将默认的原版边界图片替换为更现代且更容易察觉的新样式。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原版边界在白天有时很难发现，你必须非常靠近才能看清。现在，你可以轻松地从远处查看世界边界。此外，它在夜间还会呈现不同的颜色色调。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>请参阅下方示例</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白天：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/984/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/985/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">夜晚：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/986/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/990/2024-09-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就搭建一个服务器，与好友一起畅玩！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 立减25%！</span></p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"